<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modelers.Eventing.Api" #>
<#@ import namespace="Aryzac.GitHubIssues.Api" #>
---
id: <#= Model.Id #>
title: "task(integration event): Publish <#= Model.Name #> integration event"
type: task
<# if (Model.HasGitHubIssueClosed()) { #>
closed: true
<# } else { #>
closed: false
<# } #>
---
<# if (Model.HasBusinessRequirement()) { #>

### Business Goal

<#= Model.GetBusinessRequirement().Summary() #>
<# if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Comment)) { #>

<#= Model.Comment #>
<# } } #>

### Scope & Notes

| Property | Type | Nullable | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
<# foreach (var property in Model.Properties) { #>
| <#= property.Name #> | <#= property.TypeReference.Element.Name #> <#= property.TypeReference.IsCollection ? "[]" : "" #> | <#= property.TypeReference.IsNullable ? "Yes" : "No" #> | <#= string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(property.Comment) ? "" : property.Comment #> |
<# } #>

Estimated Effort
Estimated Days: 0.25

| Task                                    | Target Hours       |
|-----------------------------------------|--------------------|
| Confirm domain event + handler location | 0.25h              |
| Define integration message contract     | 0.25h              |
| Map & publish in handler                | 0.5h               |
| Configure DI / bus wiring               | 0.25h              |
| Documentation updates                   | 0.25h              |
| Buffer                                  | 0.25h              |
| Total Target Hours                      | 1.75h (≈ 0.25 day) |

Acceptance Checklist
- [ ] Integration event contract (<#= Model.Name #>V1Event) defined and versioned
- [ ] Domain event handler publishes message via IEventBus
- [ ] Bus registration / configuration updated as required
- [ ] Validation approach for publish path recorded (automated or manual)
- [ ] Documentation updated (this recipe referenced)
- [ ] Effort variance >20% captured in issue comments